>>
Rule 1 (input tensor dtype must not be boolean)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 2 (input tensor dtype must not be complex)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 9 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 10
>>
Rule 3 (inplace flag must be a boolean literal)
{v_2 : bool} |= v_2 = true ∨ v_2 = false
>>
Rule 6 (in-place application requires a real, non-boolean dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : bool} |= if v_2 = true then 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 8 (all tensor dimensions are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
